  (text "Hand-wired build (Option B). Same matrix and pins as the PCB version, so the firmware is identical.\nKeys: 3 x 7 matrix, diode cathode (band) towards the ROW wire. ROW0 = GP28, ROW1 = GP29, ROW2 = GP15.\nCOL0..COL6 = GP9, GP10, GP11, GP12, GP13, GP26, GP27.  Status lights: GP14 -> 330R -> LED1 DIN, chained LED1 -> LED10.\nLED order: left column top->bottom (LED1-5), then right column bottom->top (LED6-10).\nUSB_LINK: short USB cable from the RP2040-Zero USB-C to the Pi Zero micro-USB DATA port (powers the RP2040 and LEDs).\nPI_5V: USB-C panel socket on the back plate -> Pi Zero micro-USB PWR port. Keep LED brightness low in firmware." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 235 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5d966927-70a8-4ed9-8ccf-e5b2dbde3c30"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
